% SUPERSEDED — do not use. The bibliography is paper/tex/refs.bib.
%
% This file was a second, independently written bibliography with 41 entries and a
% different set of citation keys (`fisher1935` here vs `fisher1935design` there). Two
% bibliographies for one paper is two chances to be wrong and no way to tell which is
% right, so it is retired rather than merged.
%
% paper/tex/refs.bib is the one to use: each of its 42 entries reconciles against
% paper/references.md, where every reference is marked verified against the published
% record. `python scripts/check_bib.py` enforces that correspondence and fails if an entry
% drifts or is a placeholder — it is how the missing author list for Barunik, Hronec &
% Tobek (2024) was caught.
%
% The file is emptied rather than deleted so that any stale \bibliography{references}
% fails loudly at build time instead of silently compiling an out-of-date reference list.
% If you are reading this because a build broke: point it at paper/tex/refs instead.
% =========================================================================
